giggsey/libphonenumber-for-php
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

A PHP port of Google's libphonenumber. It supplies every parsing, validation and
formatting decision this package makes, plus the geocoding, carrier and timezone
metadata exposed on the value object. It is a `require`, not a `suggest` — the
package does nothing without it.

Apache-2.0 is permissive and compatible with the MIT licence above; the two
coexist without either being relicensed. It is recorded here because Apache-2.0
section 4(d) asks that attribution notices be carried, and because a consumer
auditing licences downstream should not have to discover it from the lock file.

The underlying phone-number metadata is Google's, distributed with that port
under the same terms.
